<title>USA: Xerox Corp Q3 continuing operations net off.</title>
<headline>Xerox Corp Q3 continuing operations net off.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr		    $0.71		    $0.74</p>
<p> Oper shr diluted	  $0.68		    $0.70</p>
<p> Oper net		  250,000		  256,000</p>
<p> Revs		    4,158,000		4,012,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  333,600		  332,400</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	364,300		  364,500</p>
<p>			Nine Months</p>
<p> Oper shr		    $2.24		    $2.01</p>
<p> Oper shr diluted	  $2.14		    $1.91</p>
<p> Oper net		  780,000		  697,000</p>
<p> Revs		   12,303,000	     11,833,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  333,600		  330,400</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	364,300		  362,500</p>
<p>	    (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: 1995 operating net excludes losses from discontinued insurance operations of $20 million in quarter and $76 million in nine months which were equal to $0.06 and $0.23/shr, respectively, on a primary basis and $0.05 and $0.21/shr fully diluted.</p>
<p>Company is not reporting 1996 insurance results.</p>
</text>
